  "instructions": [
    "Bring a large pot of water to a boil and cook the rice noodles according to the package instructions.",
    "In a large skillet, heat the coconut oil over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the gochujang, soy sauce, and honey to the skillet and stir to combine.",
    "Add the sauerkraut and kimchi to the skillet and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for 2-3 minutes, or until the sauerkraut is slightly caramelized.",
    "Add the cooked noodles to the skillet and stir to combine with the sauerkraut mixture.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Transfer the noodles to a serving dish and garnish with sesame seeds and scallions."
